cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NumericAL, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "NumericAL — a numerical computing Algorithmic Library"
abstract: "A header-only C++20 numerical computing library (tensors, Einstein summation, dense linear algebra, matrix functions and FFT) whose answers are the same to the bit on any number of threads, with a NumPy- and SciPy-compatible Python binding and a BLAS and LAPACK ABI."
authors:
